---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, NOT_AFFILIATED } from '../../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About AyTool – Independent Philippine Payroll Calculators"
  description="AyTool is an independent site offering free Philippine payroll calculators based on official sources. Not affiliated with any government agency."
  path="/about/"
>
  <article class="content-prose mx-auto max-w-content px-4 pt-8">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink sm:text-3xl">About AyTool</h1>
    <p class="mt-4">
      AyTool, an independent Philippine payroll calculator, exists to answer one kind of question
      well: <em>"how much?"</em> — how much SSS is deducted from a ₱20,000 salary, how much 13th
      month pay a mid-year hire receives, how much take-home pay is left after all the mandatory
      deductions.
    </p>
    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Free calculators for SSS, PhilHealth and Pag-IBIG contributions, 13th month pay, take-home pay, holiday pay, night differential, overtime and final pay.</li>
      <li>Every rate comes from the official source — SSS circulars, PhilHealth advisories, HDMF circulars, the BIR withholding table, DOLE labor advisories and Malacañang proclamations — and every page shows the schedule used, its effective date and when we last verified it. See our <a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a> and <a href="/sources/">Sources</a>.</li>
      <li>All calculations run entirely in your browser. We never ask for — and cannot see — your salary, your government IDs, or your account credentials.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What we deliberately don't do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We do not connect to any government system, host exam results, or "check your contributions" — anything that requires your records happens only on the official government portals, and we link you there.</li>
      <li>We never ask for SSS/PhilHealth/Pag-IBIG numbers, passwords, or OTPs. Any site that does while looking like a calculator is one to avoid.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Independence</h2>
    <p>{NOT_AFFILIATED}</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Spotted a wrong number or an outdated rate? Email
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> — corrections are treated as
      the highest-priority work on this site.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
